      parameter:
      - RoomEnd Door4 Light
  - text: '```"I choose hope."'
    displayText: '"I choose hope."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya said it first, $$but Rika's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. $$They made the same choice.
    displayText: Maya said it first, but Rika's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. They made the same choice.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 14000000140000004d0000004d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "I want to believe\u2014believe that people can change."
    displayText: "I want to believe\u2014believe that people can change."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The world is a horrible mess. $$It's true that I and everyone have done
      something irredeemable. $$But if I run away from it, $$then what?
    displayText: The world is a horrible mess. It's true that I and everyone have
      done something irredeemable. But if I run away from it, then what?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000005e0000005e0000007900000079000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Everything will stay the same, $$nothing will change.
    displayText: Everything will stay the same, nothing will change.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1f0000001f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yes. $$You made a mistake. $$Everyone made a mistake. $$We are all drowning
      and gasping for air, $$scrambling for any chance to survive.
    displayText: Yes. You made a mistake. Everyone made a mistake. We are all drowning
      and gasping for air, scrambling for any chance to survive.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0500000005000000190000001900000032000000320000005b0000005b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And in that, $$they pulled me down.
    displayText: And in that, they pulled me down.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0d0000000d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And you pulled them down too. $$That's what drowning does. $$You can't
      blame them.
    displayText: And you pulled them down too. That's what drowning does. You can't
      blame them.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000003900000039000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Even if I die, $$it won't solve anything. $$They'll still be drowning.
    displayText: Even if I die, it won't solve anything. They'll still be drowning.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0f0000000f0000002800000028000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Even if others die, $$it won't solve anything. $$We'll still be drowning.
    displayText: Even if others die, it won't solve anything. We'll still be drowning.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 14000000140000002d0000002d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: So I just have to keep swimming, $$in hope that maybe one day, $$someone
      will reach the shore and end this cycle once and for all.
    displayText: So I just have to keep swimming, in hope that maybe one day, someone
      will reach the shore and end this cycle once and for all.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 21000000210000003d0000003d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: They walked towards the door. $$Rika's hand trembled slightly. $$The weight
      hasn't lifted, $$it never will. $$Yet, $$she chose to keep carrying it forward.
    displayText: They walked towards the door. Rika's hand trembled slightly. The
      weight hasn't lifted, it never will. Yet, she chose to keep carrying it forward.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000003d0000003d000000570000005700000066000000660000006b0000006b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: This is the final choice they made by themselves, $$and the only choice
      that will satisfy her.
    displayText: This is the final choice they made by themselves, and the only choice
      that will satisfy her.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3200000032000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika and Maya fused into one. $$As they reached out for the handle, $$the
      door shimmered and dissolved into light particles scattering in all directions.
    displayText: Rika and Maya fused into one. As they reached out for the handle,
      the door shimmered and dissolved into light particles scattering in all directions.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000004200000042000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And.$.$.
    displayText: And...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '                                                                                                      '
    displayText: '                                                                                                      '
    color: 0
