    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika's fingers twitch against a cold and rough bed sheet.
    displayText: Rika's fingers twitch against a cold and rough bed sheet.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The hospital's sanitized smell is as strong as ever. $$Rika doesn't like
      it.
    displayText: The hospital's sanitized smell is as strong as ever. Rika doesn't
      like it.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3500000035000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Agh.$.$. $$I want to smell something nicer.$.$.
    displayText: Agh... I want to smell something nicer...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 040000000500000007000000070000002700000028000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"You awake? $$Rika, $$do you know where you are?"'
    displayText: '"You awake? Rika, do you know where you are?"'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0c0000000c0000001200000012000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "\"Hospital? $$W-What happened.$.$.? $$Where is Ma\u2014\""
    displayText: "\"Hospital? W-What happened...? Where is Ma\u2014\""
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 780e7268fcdef544198c0b3d5d94d3f9, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0b0000000b0000001b0000001c0000001f0000001f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Ma?"'
    displayText: '"Ma?"'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Ma\u2014"
    displayText: "Ma\u2014"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika is confused about her instinctive action. $$Who was she looking for?
      $$She's always been alone.
    displayText: Rika is confused about her instinctive action. Who was she looking
      for? She's always been alone.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2f0000002f0000004800000048000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Do you mean your mama? $$That would be me though."'
    displayText: '"Do you mean your mama? That would be me though."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1800000018000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: No.$.$.Forget that.$.$.Anyway, $$why are you here after all this time?
    displayText: No...Forget that...Anyway, why are you here after all this time?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 030000000400000011000000120000001b0000001b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Hey, $$how low do you think of me? $$How can a mother abandon her child
      when that child is literally trying to unalive herself?"'
    displayText: '"Hey, how low do you think of me? How can a mother abandon her
      child when that child is literally trying to unalive herself?"'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000002200000022000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Huh?
    displayText: Huh?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e23284570d4398b45acdfcf5a62324b6, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"What''s that reaction.$.$.? $$Or do you not think of me as your mother
      anymore? $$If that''s the case, $$I''m quite sad.$.$."'
    displayText: '"What''s that reaction...? Or do you not think of me as your mother
      anymore? If that''s the case, I''m quite sad..."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 16000000170000001a0000001a0000004c0000004c00000060000000600000006e0000006f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: What? $$No. $$It's not like that.$.$.
    displayText: What? No. It's not like that...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000000a0000000a0000001d0000001e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Meeting her again in years feels awkward. $$Their relationship is not like
      a normal mother-daughter relationship. $$It's just.$.$.awkward.
    displayText: Meeting her again in years feels awkward. Their relationship is
      not like a normal mother-daughter relationship. It's just...awkward.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2a0000002a00000070000000700000007a0000007b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: This uncomfortable silence continues for a while.
    displayText: This uncomfortable silence continues for a while.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"This might not be the time.$.$.., $$but here''s a gift from one of your
      friends. $$I couldn''t find the right moment to give it to you before travelling
      to America. $$Sorry.$.$."'
    displayText: '"This might not be the time...., but here''s a gift from one of
      your friends. I couldn''t find the right moment to give it to you before travelling
      to America. Sorry..."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1c0000001d00000021000000210000004d0000004d0000009e0000009e000000a4000000a5000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The mother passed a small box to Rika. $$There is a note attached to it,
      $$written in Mahiru's handwriting.
    displayText: The mother passed a small box to Rika. There is a note attached
      to it, written in Mahiru's handwriting.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 27000000270000004700000047000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The note reads, "You're nice. $$Everyone wants to be friends with you.
      $$Let's have fun together with them in the future!"
    displayText: The note reads, "You're nice. Everyone wants to be friends with
      you. Let's have fun together with them in the future!"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000004500000045000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Inside, $$there is a flower. A plum blossom.
    displayText: Inside, there is a flower. A plum blossom.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0800000008000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"If you don''t like that message, $$then you can throw it away. $$I just
      want you to know that Mahiru does care about you.$.$. $$That''s all.$.$."'
    displayText: '"If you don''t like that message, then you can throw it away. I
      just want you to know that Mahiru does care about you... That''s all..."'
    color: 4
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Mother
    textColor: {r: 0.2, g: 0.6, b: 0.6, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 21000000210000003d0000003d000000750000007600000078000000780000008300000084000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika smiled.
    displayText: Rika smiled.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: No.$.$. $$It's fine.$.$. $$Thank you. $$And.$.$. $$Sorry.
    displayText: No... It's fine... Thank you. And... Sorry.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 03000000040000000600000006000000100000001100000013000000130000001e0000001e00000022000000230000002500000025000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika took out the bracelet that's still on her wrist, $$Mahiru's bracelet,
      $$and placed it in the box.
    displayText: Rika took out the bracelet that's still on her wrist, Mahiru's bracelet,
      and placed it in the box.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 36000000360000004900000049000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Life has always been hard. $$She has made a great mistake.
